{"parse":{"title":"技能图鉴库/咒刃·血戮","pageid":5785,"revid":13549,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%C2%B7%E8%A1%80%E6%88%AE&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%C2%B7%E8%A1%80%E6%88%AE&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%C2%B7%E8%A1%80%E6%88%AE&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>咒刃·血戮</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E5.92.92.E5.88.83.C2.B7.E8.A1.80.E6.88.AE\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"咒刃·血戮\"><b>咒刃·血戮</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E7%AE%80%E5%8D%95%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">技能详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\"><img alt=\"技能 咒刃血戮.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/00/42ge055lcnrmi25nhibzqku1hxhdi0a.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%E8%A1%80%E6%88%AE.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/00/42ge055lcnrmi25nhibzqku1hxhdi0a.png/120px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD_%E5%92%92%E5%88%83%E8%A1%80%E6%88%AE.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/0/00/42ge055lcnrmi25nhibzqku1hxhdi0a.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />咒刃·血戮\n</th>\n<td class=\"text-left text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><center><b>&#160;技能类别<br /></b>[职业技能]</center>\n</td>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:70%;\">&#160;\n<p>（被动）伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">15%</font>，拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"咒铠·裁罚\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">咒铠·裁罚</font></span></span>]时提高至<font color=\"#ed7950\">30%</font>。行动开始时，若自身拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"咒铠·缚罪\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">咒铠·缚罪</font></span></span>]且受到[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"定身\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">定身</font></span></span>]，则触发技能[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"以血浇灌\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">以血浇灌</font></span></span>]（该技能不在冷却中），触发后获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"咒痕\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">咒痕</font></span></span>]。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div>\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%